    m_Localized: Bonjour!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798713
    m_Localized: Hello! I am a fruit and vegetable vendor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798714
    m_Localized: I sell vegetables like lettuce, tomatoes, and carrots. I sell fruits
      like lemons, apples, and bananas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798715
    m_Localized: Au revoir!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798716
    m_Localized: Merci!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798717
    m_Localized: "Bonne journ\xE9e!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798719
    m_Localized: What do you want to buy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798720
    m_Localized: Tomatoes, Oranges, and Lemons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798721
    m_Localized: Bread
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798722
    m_Localized: Milk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798723
    m_Localized: Salt, Pepper, and Oil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798724
    m_Localized: Merci!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798725
    m_Localized: Bonjour!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798726
    m_Localized: Livre!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798727
    m_Localized: Hello! I'm a grocer. I sell spices like salt and pepper. But I also
      sell other ingredients like flour and sugar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798728
    m_Localized: You can use my items for many recipes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798729
    m_Localized: Ahoy! Welcome aboard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798730
    m_Localized: We are pirates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798731
    m_Localized: Pirates have large ships to cross the seas and oceans.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798732
    m_Localized: Long ago, pirates searched for treasure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798733
    m_Localized: The pirates also attacked other ships. They stole items and jewelry
      from the ships.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798734
    m_Localized: so the shops can stay open!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798735
    m_Localized: Hello! Welcome to the city of Marseille. You're going to the market.
      You're going to buy ingredients to prepare a bouillabaisse. Bouillabaisse is
      a traditional fish soup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798736
    m_Localized: I want to prepare a traditional dish from Marseille for you. A bouillabaisse!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798737
    m_Localized: But I need your help to go buy the ingredients.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798738
    m_Localized: Go to the market and bring me back the ingredients to prepare a
      bouillabaisse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798739
    m_Localized: Say "hello" to the market vendors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798740
    m_Localized: Say "goodbye" when you have finished shopping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798741
    m_Localized: Don't forget to say "thank you" to the shopkeepers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798742
    m_Localized: Go back and watch the chef cook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798743
    m_Localized: Well done! You managed to buy all the ingredients.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798744
    m_Localized: You greeted everyone with "hello". You thanked all the shopkeepers
      with "thank you".
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125433798745
    m_Localized: Now, let's prepare the boullabaise recipe together!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992960
    m_Localized: Match each food item to its seller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992961
    m_Localized: Well done! You managed to match each food item with its vendor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992962
    m_Localized: 'Now, I''m going to prepare the fish soup: bouillabaisse!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992963
    m_Localized: You now need to pay for your purchases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992964
    m_Localized: You now need to pay for your purchases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992965
    m_Localized: You now need to pay for your purchases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992966
    m_Localized: You now need to pay for your purchases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992970
    m_Localized: Sorry, I don't think I understand...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992971
    m_Localized: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992972
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992973
    m_Localized: Bread
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992974
    m_Localized: Fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992975
    m_Localized: Orange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992976
    m_Localized: Lemon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992977
    m_Localized: Tomato
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992978
    m_Localized: Milk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992979
    m_Localized: Salt and Pepper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 125437992981
    m_Localized: Olive oil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80762619944960
    m_Localized: Complete the image.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83685710094337
    m_Localized: Go see all the vendors at the market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 83685710094336
    m_Localized: I need more ingredients!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 845723419926530
    m_Localized: Crab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 845723419926528
    m_Localized: Collect all the ingredients for the recipe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 862493363003393
    m_Localized: Sorry, I don't sell that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850964
    m_Localized: A greengrocer sells fruits and veggies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850963
    m_Localized: A cheesemonger sells products made with milk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850960
    m_Localized: Sometimes we eat bread with the soup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850959
    m_Localized: Olive oil adds flavor to the dish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850958
    m_Localized: The tomato is delicious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850955
    m_Localized: You gave the right amount of money. Well done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850954
    m_Localized: In France and Europe, the currency is called the euro. There are
      coins and banknotes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2282159460048896
    m_Localized: What is your favourite food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850962
    m_Localized: A fishmonger sells fish and crab.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850961
    m_Localized: A baker bakes bread. He also prepares croissants and cakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850957
    m_Localized: Boullabaise soup contains many fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850956
    m_Localized: You can pay with coins and bills. But you can also pay with a bank
      card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850953
    m_Localized: I'm looking forward to cooking a delicious meal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850952
    m_Localized: The fish is delicious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850951
    m_Localized: You can find good products at the market.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850950
    m_Localized: I need to buy some fresh ingredients.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850949
    m_Localized: The bouillabaisse is my favorite dish!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850948
    m_Localized: It's very pleasant to do your shopping at the market!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850947
    m_Localized: I love the sea!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850946
    m_Localized: The food here is amazing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850945
    m_Localized: Hello! I'm visiting the city of Marseille.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619984850944
    m_Localized: What is your favourite food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2381619980656640
    m_Localized: Well done! You managed to buy all the ingredients for the chef!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6601427467100160
    m_Localized: You already bought bread from me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6601427496460292
    m_Localized: Now go! I have to prepare for my next trip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6601427496460293
    m_Localized: You have to pay for your groceries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9168233005703181
    m_Localized: Go see the other sellers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9168233005703179
    m_Localized: You already bought from me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9168233005703176
    m_Localized: You already bought fruit from me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9168233005703172
    m_Localized: You already bought milk from me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9168233005703170
    m_Localized: You already bought fish from me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9168233005703168
    m_Localized: I've put your purchases on the table next to you. Help yourself!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9169988422590464
    m_Localized: hello
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
